<p class="eyebrow" data-copy-en="Character guide" data-copy-zh="角色攻略">Character guide</p>
<h1 data-copy-en="The King" data-copy-zh="The King">The King</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Potato quest, royal appointment, court accounts and proclamation." data-copy-zh="土豆任务、王室任命、宫廷账目与公告。">Potato quest, royal appointment, court accounts and proclamation.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find them</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">What usually blocks the next step</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">在哪里找到</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系节点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">常见卡点</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Leadership_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Audience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: The King — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/king-graham.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The King — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/king-graham.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>The King — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>The King connects the potato quest, Rose &amp; Thorn’s appointment and later court accounts. He also offers a one-time Leadership increase and a paid proclamation service.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Where_to_Find_the_King"></span><h2>Where to find them</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Place</th><th scope="col">Portrait hours</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Throne Room</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Royal Bedroom</th><td data-label="Portrait hours">21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="Condition">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="en-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Request_Royal_Proclamation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Later_Court_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Food-Supply_Quest"></span><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>For the early appointment, follow the current quest through Christy’s Potato Education, present the Sack of Potatoes at the Throne Room, complete Wilfred’s delivery and return for the appointment. Presenting the solution consumes the Sack. Elara must not be away on vacation for these shared early scenes.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: personal and shared event navigation</summary><p>Each listed event happens once. Return to the named place after completing its prior steps. Completion affection is a base reward; dialogue choices can add further affection. The scenes and choice answers remain in the game.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Event</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base completion affection</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">The King's Challenge</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; The King Stranger (0); Elara Stranger (0); The Sorceress's Confession; Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Potato Solution</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; The King Stranger (0); Elara Stranger (0); Potato Cultivation Mastery; 1 Sack of Potatoes; Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Royal Appointment</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; The King Stranger (0); Elara Stranger (0); Potato Knowledge Delivery; Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara Returns To Court</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; Elara Known (25); The King Acknowledged (10); The Gatehouse Warning; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 9; Elara not on vacation</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Elara +8; The King +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Suitor Refused</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; Vespa Close Friend (200); The King Acknowledged (10); Prince Barnard Known (25); A Rumor With Good Breeding; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 16</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">Vespa +12; The King +4; Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">The Unsigned Form</th><td data-label="Requirements">Throne Room; 10:00–17:00; The King Known (25); Lord Chamberlain Acquaintance (50); Prince Barnard Acquaintance (50); Elara's Terms; Rose &amp; Thorn reputation 18</td><td data-label="Base completion affection">The King +6; Lord Chamberlain +8; Prince Barnard +6</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Requirements / usable start time</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Reward / normal limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk to The King</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Throne Room / Royal Bedroom; Stranger (0)</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">15 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+1 base affection; 5/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Leadership Wisdom</th><td data-label="Requirements / usable start time">Throne Room; Known (25); Communication 50</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Reward / normal limit">+8 direct affection; Leadership +1; once</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The proclamation and court-account discussion are Throne Room location actions. Their exact requirements are below; the account discussion starts at 17:00 even though the King’s normal daytime portrait ends then.</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location action</th><th scope="col">Conditions</th><th scope="col">Cost</th><th scope="col">Result</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Discuss the Rose &amp; Thorn Accounts</th><td data-label="Conditions">Royal Appointment + Chamberlain introduction; both Acknowledged (10); reputation 4; Throne Room 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; once</td><td data-label="Result">starts the court route</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Request Royal Proclamation</th><td data-label="Conditions">reputation 2; Throne Room 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="Cost">0 min; $2,000; once</td><td data-label="Result">promotion level +1</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The Royal Appointment grants Rose &amp; Thorn ownership, its initial rooms and Elara’s worker entry. See the management guide for the starting setup.</p><details><summary>Optional reference: affection bonuses</summary><p>Each favorite-stat threshold adds 1 to ordinary base affection before other bonuses; the favorite skill doubles the adjusted base. Direct rewards remain the listed direct amount.</p><p>Strength 80; Charm 80; Commerce 80</p><p>Favorite skill: Leadership</p></details><p>Start windows exclude their ending hour. Costs are base values; applicable skills and active bonuses may change them. Base affection, direct affection and NPC intimacy experience are distinct. Dialogue choices can add rewards beyond the listed event-completion base.</p></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>What usually blocks the next step</h2><ul><li>Bring the actual Sack of Potatoes key item for the solution event; ordinary ingredients cannot replace it.</li><li>For court accounts, check both introductions, reputation 4 and Acknowledged (10) with the King and Chamberlain.</li></ul></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><ul><li><a href="character-christy.html">Christy</a></li><li><a href="character-wilfred.html">Wilfred</a></li><li><a href="character-lord-chamberlain.html">Lord Chamberlain</a></li><li><a href="character-vespa.html">Vespa</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">Rose &amp; Thorn</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">Location reference</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">Story navigation</a></li></ul></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Leadership_Wisdom"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Audience"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：The King 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/king-graham.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="The King 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/king-graham.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>The King 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>The King 连接土豆任务、玫瑰与荆棘的任命，以及后续宫廷账目路线，也提供一次性领导力提升与付费公告服务。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Where_to_Find_the_King"></span><h2>在哪里找到</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">肖像在场时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">王座厅</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">皇家卧室</th><td data-label="肖像在场时段">21:00–24:00</td><td data-label="条件">—</td></tr></tbody></table></section>
<section id="zh-route"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Request_Royal_Proclamation"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Later_Court_Route"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Food-Supply_Quest"></span><h2>路线与关系节点</h2><p>前期任命请跟随当前任务：完成 Christy 的土豆种植课，在王座厅提交一袋土豆，再完成 Wilfred 的递送并回访。提交方案会消耗这袋土豆；这些早期共同事件要求 Elara 未在度假。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：个人与共同事件的触发条件</summary><p>下列事件均为一次性内容。完成前置后，请返回对应地点。完成好感度列为基础奖励，对话选择还可能追加好感度。剧情与选项答案请在游戏中体验。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">完成基础好感度</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">国王的挑战</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; The King 陌生人 (0); Elara 陌生人 (0); 女术士的坦白; Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">土豆方案</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; The King 陌生人 (0); Elara 陌生人 (0); 土豆种植大师课; 1 一袋土豆; Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">王室任命</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; The King 陌生人 (0); Elara 陌生人 (0); 土豆知识送达; Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">The King +5; Elara +5</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Elara重返宫廷</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; Elara 已知 (25); The King 已遇见 (10); 门楼警告; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 9; Elara 未在度假</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Elara +8; The King +4</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">被拒绝的求婚者</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; Vespa 亲密朋友 (200); The King 已遇见 (10); Prince Barnard 已知 (25); 一个有良好教养的谣言; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 16</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">Vespa +12; The King +4; Prince Barnard +6</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">未签名表格</th><td data-label="条件">王座厅; 10:00–17:00; The King 已知 (25); Lord Chamberlain 相识 (50); Prince Barnard 相识 (50); Elara 的条款; 玫瑰与荆棘声誉 18</td><td data-label="完成基础好感度">The King +6; Lord Chamberlain +8; Prince Barnard +6</td></tr></tbody></table></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">行动</th><th scope="col">条件／可开始时间</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">奖励／常规次数</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">与国王交谈</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">王座厅／皇家卧室; 陌生人 (0)</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">15 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+1 基础好感度; 5次/日</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">领导智慧</th><td data-label="条件／可开始时间">王座厅; 已知 (25); 沟通 50</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30 分钟</td><td data-label="奖励／常规次数">+8 直接好感度; 领导力 +1; 一次性</td></tr></tbody></table><p>公告与账目讨论属于王座厅地点行动，确切条件见下表。账目讨论从 17:00 开始，即使国王的普通白天肖像此时离场，地点行动仍按自己的时段提供。</p><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点行动</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">消耗</th><th scope="col">结果</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">讨论玫瑰与荆棘账目</th><td data-label="条件">王室任命与 Lord Chamberlain 介绍已完成；两人均已遇见（10）；声誉 4；王座厅 17:00–19:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；一次性</td><td data-label="结果">开启宫廷路线</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">请求皇家公告</th><td data-label="条件">声誉 2；王座厅 10:00–17:00</td><td data-label="消耗">0 分钟；$2,000；一次性</td><td data-label="结果">宣传等级 +1</td></tr></tbody></table><p>王室任命会授予玫瑰与荆棘所有权、初始房间及 Elara 的员工名额；起步配置见经营指南。</p><details><summary>可选查阅：好感度加成</summary><p>每达到一项偏好属性门槛，普通好感度计算的基础值增加 1；偏好技能会将调整后的基础值翻倍。直接奖励仍按标明的直接数值加入。</p><p>力量 80; 魅力 80; 商业 80</p><p>偏好技能：领导力</p></details><p>开始时段不包含结束整点。消耗为基础值，适用技能与当前加成可能改变实际数值。基础好感度、直接好感度与 NPC 亲密经验分别计算；对话选择还可能在事件完成基础奖励之外追加奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>常见卡点</h2><ul><li>方案事件要求真正的一袋土豆关键物品，普通食材不能代替。</li><li>账目讨论需完成相关介绍与任命，声誉达到 4，且 The King 与 Lord Chamberlain 都达到已遇见（10）。</li></ul></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><ul><li><a href="character-christy.html">Christy</a></li><li><a href="character-wilfred.html">Wilfred</a></li><li><a href="character-lord-chamberlain.html">Lord Chamberlain</a></li><li><a href="character-vespa.html">Vespa</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-brothel.html">玫瑰与荆棘</a></li><li><a href="locations.html">地点参考</a></li><li><a href="game-systems-story-beats.html">主线导航</a></li></ul></section>
